msgstr "找不到。FACEIT 需要 TPM：大多數電腦的處理器都內建，在韌體設定中開啟即可（Intel PTT 或 AMD fTPM）。"

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:85
msgid "Virtualization-based security"
msgstr "虛擬化型安全性"

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:85
