msgstr "Epic 和 GOG 遊戲"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7869
msgid ""
"In Heroic, choose Windows games as the folder when you install one, and Windows plays it too: Epic's launcher there takes it over, and GOG's games start by themselves."
msgstr ""
"在 Heroic 中安裝遊戲時，選擇「Windows games」作為資料夾，Windows 也能玩：那邊由 Epic 啟動器接手，GOG 遊戲則會直接啟動。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7876
msgid ""
"Get Heroic for your Epic and GOG games. One you install in Windows games plays in Windows too."
msgstr "取得 Heroic 來玩您的 Epic 和 GOG 遊戲。裝在「Windows games」裡的遊戲在 Windows 中也能玩。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7879
msgid "Getting Heroic…"
msgstr "正在取得 Heroic…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7879
msgid "Get Heroic"
msgstr "取得 Heroic"

