msgstr "取得 %1"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7924
msgid ""
"A folder Windows has too, as Shared with Monet: save a download, a mod or an installer there once, and it's in both. Files lists it with your places."
msgstr ""
"Windows 也有的一個資料夾，名為「Shared with Monet」：把下載的檔案、模組或安裝程式在這裡儲存一次，兩邊都有。檔案會在您的位置中顯示它。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7934
msgid "Where your games are"
msgstr "遊戲存放位置"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7960
msgid "Steam, Heroic and Lutris keep theirs here once you install one"
msgstr "安裝 Steam、Heroic 或 Lutris 後，它們的遊戲會放在這裡"

